      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Spec lifecycle & graduation — the durable trace (FR-013)",
      "prov:value": "Owner ruling, 2026-10-07:\n> *\"Specs live in GitHub issue comments; upon completion, accepted requirements\n> graduate directly into governing skills (as req:* statements) and automated\n> tests, keeping SDLC churn off the knowledge graph.\"*",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-07"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-07"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/spec-kit/spec-kit.md#provenance-5",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Spec lifecycle & graduation — the durable trace (FR-013)",
      "prov:value": "**Filing at adjudication** (owner, 2026-10-30, option E on cat-harness#686):\n   when the spec reaches `Adjudicated`, its accepted `FR-NNN` are filed as a\n   `req:*` file under `cat-harness/skills/requirements/` with\n   `status: proposed` and `proposedIn` naming the governing issue.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "cat-harness#686",
        "2026-10-30"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-30"
      ]
